r_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-round-half-even", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 375455, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01HUjFxRfzXsrj8Y9SqRdtBT", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 379106, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug on a new branch, CI passed, and I opened PR #101 against main with alex as reviewer.\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, even though its own docstring says banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`, per FIN-212). `tests/test_money.py` expects `2.665` to round to `2.66`, so the test failed.\n- **Fix:** On branch `fix/money-round-half-even`, I changed `round_money` to use `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` (commit 08d3cd5986). That one line is the only change.\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed.\n- **PR:** https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\nI couldn't look up FIN-212 because the advisory tool returned \"unknown advisory.\" The fix follows what the test and the docstring already say.\n\nI haven't merged the PR, since merging into main needs approval from a code owner.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_013w2nuUMxaP52innW8DjRxy", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01X7f1SyoAFGmFWShVq2hZD5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_018HDcjqLfYwEkc6jDLSHx9s", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"id": "FIN-212"}, "name": "get_advisory", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01PLRtPanQJHpGsRT4Jz4TXw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-round-half-even"}, "name": "create